+- `skills/z-audit-plan/SKILL.md:1` — `z-audit-plan` — Read-only pre-implementation audit of existing plan artifacts. It verifies references and design, runs adversarial consultants, writes PLAN_AUDIT_REPORT.md, and routes to `/z-plan`, `/z-amend`, or `/z-maintain-docs` only through the shared route handoff gate.
